## Components
- `src/router/` — Routing logic and backend selection
- `src/io/ollama/` — Ollama LLM handler
- `src/io/llm_gemini/` — Gemini LLM handler

## Responsibilities
- Route `chat_request` to appropriate LLM backend
- Normalize responses into `llm_response` messages
- Support multiple backends (Ollama, Gemini, future Grok)

